<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</title>
<headline>Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-09-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sunday's spot rupee rates in kerb market from Khanani &amp; Kalia Int'l (Pvt) Ltd:</p>
<p>				buying rate	 selling rate</p>
<p>    U.S. dollar	   40.30		 40.40</p>
<p>    Pound sterling	62.65		 62.75</p>
<p>    Deutsche mark	 26.45		 26.50</p>
<p>    Japanese yen	   0.364		 0.366</p>
<p>    Saudi riyal	   10.70		 10.72</p>
<p>    UAE dirham	    10.94		 10.96</p>
<p>    Indian rupee	   1.08		  1.10</p>
<p>    F.E.B.C.		 8.80 pct	    9.00 pct</p>
</text>
